10:25.600 --> 10:27.040
Hi, this is the consulting base.

10:28.320 --> 10:29.600
I think he knew all along. But.

10:29.600 --> 10:31.920
It was Bob McCauley, great guy.
Bob McCauley, great guy.

10:33.440 --> 10:37.680
Yes. And then we went out to St.
