billion dollar public offering.
It was relatively small.

12:09.520 --> 12:16.480
But then we grew this company
from, so basically a couple guys
and shared offices to seven
offices,

12:17.120 --> 12:23.440
600 employees, a hundred million
dollars in revenue. And we made
money. I mean, we,

12:23.440 --> 12:27.040
oh yeah, it was profitable. We
didn't, we didn't raise a
hundred million and spend our

12:27.040 --> 12:31.120
three years losing it. We raised
a few million and we spent the
rest of the time making it.

12:32.080 --> 12:36.080
We made, we made, we made a
business and we created, that
was in the days when,

12:36.720 --> 12:41.600
when every single solution
required a custom software
development component,

12:41.600 --> 12:47.200
there was no modules, there was
no, no nothing. And everything
we built from scratch here,

12:47.200 --> 12:50.480
we kept saying, you know, if we
just start a company just for
this piece of software,

12:50.480 --> 12:54.640
we can monetize that. And then
we get too busy for the next
client. We did e-commerce and

12:55.200 --> 13:00.720
dynamically generated websites
and databases and all sorts of
versions of publishing tools.

13:00.720 --> 13:05.840
We had complete web publishing
tools. Yeah. And created them
new every single time.

13:05.840 --> 13:09.440
Three dimensional. What was that
thing, that three dimensional
thing?

13:09.440 --> 13:14.160
Oh, the thing at Vladibil, the,
the, the, I can't remember what
it was called.

13:15.440 --> 13:19.120
Oh, that, we were good at naming
stuff. So anyway, so that, that
was about three years,

13:19.120 --> 13:23.680
worked our asses off. And
particularly running a public
company where every quarter you
have

13:23.680 --> 13:28.480
to report your numbers and, you
know, bringing that together
from all these different
offices.

13:28.560 --> 13:32.560
And then all of a sudden, you
know, you turn around and it's
time to report your numbers
again.

13:32.560 --> 13:40.160
And so it's just one continuous
high speed train ride. And then
around 99,

13:42.960 --> 13:46.480
