although we had some other ideas
to,

13:53.120 --> 13:58.080
you know, really have a grand
exit and, and roll up with a
couple other firms in our
sector,

13:58.480 --> 14:04.400
and sell that to IBM. Yes, a
different strategy cast.

14:04.400 --> 14:08.240
That's a very different strategy
cast. But it was that we, you
know, we all along,

14:08.240 --> 14:14.080
I think we really wanted to get
back to our core passion of sort
of self-publishing

14:14.640 --> 14:17.520
thing that we had gotten into in
the very beginning. In the very
beginning, yeah.

14:17.520 --> 14:19.440
And we looked around one day and
we, you know,

14:20.160 --> 14:24.800
you know, where, what office did
we go to next week? Is it
Boston? Is it LA? Is it San
Francisco?

14:24.800 --> 14:30.240
And, you know, it was a lot of
