15:28.320 --> 15:32.160
we did pretty well. We were very
smart in hindsight, but that
was, we knew we,

15:32.160 --> 15:35.840
I think we kind of felt was two
months later. I mean, it was
much longer than that. Yeah.

15:35.840 --> 15:41.920
Boom. So we kind of, it was a
real company. Oh yeah. Real
clients, real company, real

15:41.920 --> 15:46.160
