15:52.960 --> 15:58.400
although I was still thinking
about, you know, broadcast, how
can I broadcast,

15:58.400 --> 16:03.360
you know, I was still into the,
how can we use this stuff to, to
fulfill my need to,

16:03.360 --> 16:09.600
for self publishing in essence.
You did some interesting things
with the cable industry.

16:09.600 --> 16:14.880
Yeah. I was still fighting that
idea that why, why does
everything have to be
distributed

16:14.880 --> 16:18.960
in a broadcast paradigm? I, I
was just fascinated with this
thing of, you know,

16:18.960 --> 16:24.720
I was playing with mesh networks
and how, how to do, uh,
